cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "simcow: Similarity-based Cohort Weighting"
version: 0.2.0
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/maxjonasbehrens/simcow"
abstract: >-
  R package that computes similarity-based weights for borrowing observations
  from external cohorts when a prediction model is fitted for a target cohort,
  with the scripts and aggregated simulation results that reproduce the paper
  "Improving prediction models by incorporating external data with weights
  based on similarity" (Behrens et al., under revision at PLOS ONE).
keywords:
  - R
  - prediction models
  - data integration
  - weighting
  - subgroups
authors:
  - family-names: Behrens
    given-names: Max
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4185-4702"
    email: max.behrens@uniklinik-freiburg.de
    affiliation: "Institute of Medical Biometry and Statistics, Faculty of Medicine and Medical Center, University of Freiburg"
